+    # This part would typically iterate over blocks near the camera or in the view frustum
+    # and set block->visibleFaces flags based on normal dot product or orientation
+    # See [S2, unofficial] for normal dot product logic
+    # See [S3, unofficial] for orientation-based flag setting
+    
+    # For the purpose of this culling method, we just return that an update is needed
